==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Relic Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Relic Doge Base]].
*1 [[Bun Bun Symbiote]] spawns as the boss after 17.33 seconds<sup>520f</sup>.
*1 [[Bore]] spawns as the boss after 17 seconds<sup>510f</sup>.
*1 [[Oldhorn]] spawns as the boss after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The enemy limit is 2, but the Relic Doge Base also counts as an enemy, so the bosses will spawn one by one.

Bring [[Delinquent Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ultra Delinquent]], [[Cat Gunslinger (Rare Cat)|Rodeo]], and [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Gato Amigo]] (for the Oldhorn), [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] and [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe]] (for the Bore), [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer]] or [[Shaman Cat (Rare Cat)|Necrodancer]], and [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus]] (for Bun Bun Symbiote). Lure as much as you can to avoid Relic Doge Base's Curse.

